(7)
If the distance from the initial state to state j can be improved by state i, state i is set as the predecessor node of state j (line 6–9 in Algorithm 7). The above operations are repeated until all states in Visit are visited. Finally, the shortest path is traced from the target state to the initial state via the array Path (line 12 in Algorithm 7).
